			"widgets_values":[
				"A cinematic vertical fantasy fashion photograph shows a young East Asian-presenting woman dancing gracefully on a stone bridge or waterside courtyard during a clear night. The composition is viewed from a low-to-mid angle, making the dancer dominate the frame against a luminous full moon positioned slightly right of center in the upper middle background. The sky is deep navy-blue with subtle gradients from darker blue at the top-left to brighter bluish gray near the moon and horizon. Wispy illuminated cloud bands surround the moon, creating a halo effect and backlighting the woman’s profile. Small orange-brown leaves drift sparsely through the air, adding motion and seasonal warmth.\n\nAcross the top-left and mid-background, dense dark green tree canopies occupy much of the left side, their foliage rendered realistically with individual clusters lit by scattered lamplight from below. Thin flowering or leafless branch shapes appear higher in the sky, especially around the moonlit upper-center and right areas. On the far left and extending into the middle distance, a narrow canal or pond runs parallel to the stone architectural structures, reflecting silver-white moonlight and warm golden lamps in shimmering ripples. Low pagoda-like rooftops and traditional wooden buildings sit softly out of focus on the far side of the water, with multiple rectangular windows glowing warm amber-yellow. These buildings recede diagonally into the distance from left-middle toward the right-side background, producing strong depth perspective.\n\nThe main structure is an ornate stone balcony or bridge wall stretching diagonally from the lower-left foreground toward the right-rear distance. Its parapets have repeating rounded arch openings supported by short square pillars with carved bases and caps. The stone surface is textured, weathered, beige-gray, and slightly uneven, with shadows collected in cracks and recesses. Moss or moisture hints line the ledge near the floor. A broad paved stone path fills the lower portion of the frame, showing irregular paving stones, damp-looking sheen, and several fallen leaves resting near the base of the railing.\n\nAt the center and slightly right of center stands the dancer in full-body framing within the environment, cropped closely by the image borders only at extremities. She appears slender and adult, likely in her twenties, with fair skin, refined facial features, an oval face, downcast eyes, defined brows, long lashes, subtle eyeliner, peach blush, glossy rose-red lipstick, and smooth highlighted makeup catching the mixed light. Her expression is serene, introspective, and elegantly composed. Her black hair is styled in a voluminous traditional updo with loose tendrils falling beside her cheeks and neck. Gold-toned hair ornaments, floral pins, beadwork, dangling chains, and tassels decorate the hairstyle, glinting against her hairline and temples.\n\nShe wears flowing period-inspired garments resembling hanfu or xianxia court attire: pale ivory, cream, champagne, and muted bronze tones made of lightweight translucent fabrics such as chiffon or gauze. Wide billowing sleeves extend outward horizontally, forming sweeping curved arcs across the left and right sides of her body. The outer robe has embroidered botanical patterns, metallic trim, lace-like edging, and fine decorative seams; underneath, fitted structured panels cinch the torso with a wrapped belt or sash featuring intricate metal closures and ornamentation. Layered skirts cascade in overlapping strips of sheer tulle and satin-like material, with some sections lifted dramatically by her movement. The dress exposes part of one thigh through a slit and wraps dynamically around her hips, knees, and ankles as if caught mid-dance. One leg extends forward barefoot except for embroidered sandal heels tied or strappy at the feet; the shoe at the lower-right corner is clearly visible, tan-brown with floral embellishment, straps, pointed toes, and platform heel styling. Translucent train fabric trails far into the bottom-right corner, curling upward and outward like smoke or windblown ribbons, semi-transparent against the cooler blue night and darker building bokeh behind it.\n\nHer arms define a fluid classical dance posture. The nearer hand at viewer-left holds a round folding fan upright and slightly diagonal in front of her chest. The fan spans roughly from her collar level down toward her waist, with slim reddish wooden ribs radiating from a small pivot point, scalloped fan ends, and printed floral or bird-and-flower imagery on a warm brown-beige surface. Fine hanging cords or handles descend from her wrist attachment alongside the fan, visually connecting fan, garment, and jewelry. Her other arm reaches backward and outward to the right, fingers relaxed and delicately bent, partially framed by the transparent sleeve. Her torso twists gently, head lowered toward the fan, while one knee bends subtly, suggesting poised movement rather than a static stance. Warm rim light outlines the folds of the gown and portions of her limbs, while cooler moonlight models the side facing away.\n\nIn the lower-right and far-right background, more traditional wooden architecture continues past the stone railing, heavily defocused with circular bokeh from window and lantern lights. Smaller points of white sparkle appear among branches and possibly reflected firefly-like insects, enhancing the dreamlike atmosphere. The entire visual field uses shallow depth of field: the dancer, fan, nearest railing, and pavement receive sharp emphasis, while the moon-lit trees, roofs, lantern rows, canal, and mountains dissolve into creamy blur. The lighting combines natural moon backlight with warm artificial illumination from lamps and ambient city or courtyard lights. The color grading balances cool midnight blues and grays with golden amber highlights, giving the scene a romantic wuxia, historical drama, or xuanhuan aesthetic. The shot feels like high-end concept art or polished commercial fantasy photography, emphasizing motion, grace, textile translucency, historic architecture, and emotional stillness."
